# NOTE: this file used to ignore *.png and *.ico. Those rules never had any
# effect on the branding they were presumably meant to keep out of the repo --
# public/images/logo.png and public/favicon.ico have always been tracked, and
# tracking beats ignoring. All they actually did was silently drop newly added
# artwork (the card images, the coin icons) from commits. Removed.

